  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_testimonial_2_comment', 'When my mother needed medical consultation in Germany, Jim and the GQ team arranged everything: hospital liaison, medical visa support, flight, and a beautiful apartment in Saarbrücken. The Twi and English translation was invaluable.'),
