  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_1_question', '1. What corporate travel management services do you provide?'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_1_answer', 'GQ Travel & Hotels provides end-to-end corporate travel management services, including business flight and hotel bookings, Deutsche Bahn train tickets, airport transfers, car rentals (including Sixt partner discounts), visa assistance, itinerary planning, and multi-leg transportation coordination. We arrange business travel for individual executives and entire teams, with consolidated invoicing and dedicated 24/7 rebooking support tailored to your company’s needs.'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_2_question', '2. What travel services do you provide in Saarbrücken, Germany, and Accra, Ghana?'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_2_answer', 'In Saarbrücken, Germany, we operate our primary travel agency and serviced city apartments on Rosenstraße, coordinate direct airport transfers to Frankfurt, Luxembourg, Stuttgart, and Brussels, handle Deutsche Bahn Rail & Fly, and direct medical tourism patients to specialized German hospitals. In Accra, Ghana, our local team coordinates Kotoka International Airport transfers, expedited 72-hour Ghana e-Visa assistance, hotel accommodations, and guided cultural tours across West Africa.'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_3_question', '3. How experienced is your team in travel bookings and arrangements?'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_3_answer', 'Founded in 2005, GQ Travel & Hotels has specialized in travel services since 2009. With over 20 years in the travel industry, we assist with worldwide flight bookings, hotel reservations, airport transfers, private jet charters, and holiday packages, offering personalized support backed by German insolvency protection (R+V Allgemeine Versicherung AG Sicherungsschein).'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_4_question', '4. What are the cancellation and refund conditions for hotel bookings?'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_4_answer', 'Your cancellation and refund rights depend on the rate selected at checkout. Best Price Rates are non-refundable in exchange for discounted rates. Flexible Rates offer free cancellation up to 14 or 24 days prior to check-in. Early Booking Rates (booked 84+ days in advance) provide free cancellation up to 28 days before arrival. In Saarbrücken, a 3.5% municipal city tax applies, and all online bookings feature a transparent €3.99 per day service commission.'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_5_question', '5. How does the airport transfer service work and what is the waiting-time policy?'),
  ('home', 'Home page', 'home_faq_5_answer', 'For airport arrivals (e.g. Frankfurt FRA, Luxembourg LUX, Accra ACC), the first 60 minutes after the flight’s actual landing time are completely free. After that, a charge of €20 per additional 30 minutes applies. For home or hotel pick-ups, the first 15 minutes are free. We create a WhatsApp group with your assigned driver so you can confirm boarding right after takeoff. Transfers can be cancelled free of charge within 24 hours of booking, or 14+ days before pickup.'),
