  ('services', 'Services', 'service_hotel-flight-holiday_description', 'At GQ Travel & Hotels, we make travel planning easy and convenient. From worldwide hotel and guesthouse reservations to flight-and-hotel holiday packages, airport transfers, and Deutsche Bahn train tickets in Germany, we help you find travel options that suit your budget and needs.

Discover exciting destinations including Ghana, Zanzibar, Kenya, Uganda, Dubai, Thailand, China, Germany and Paris, or plan your next adventure anywhere in the world.'),
